source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: scss/at-rule/interpolated-font-palette-values.scss
---

# Input

```scss
$name:brand;
@font-palette-values --palette-#{ $name }2{font-family:"Bixa"}
@font-palette-values   --palette-#{ $name } {font-family:"Bixa";override-colors:0 red}
@font-palette-values --#{ $name }-dark{font-family:"Bixa";base-palette:1}
@font-palette-values /* before */ --palette-#{ $name } /* after */ {font-family:"Bixa"}
@font-palette-values --palette-#{/* expression */$name}{font-family:"Bixa"}
@font-palette-values --Palette {font-family:"Bixa";override-colors:1 blue}

// biome-ignore format: preserve the source layout
@font-palette-values   --palette-#{ $name } {font-family:"Bixa";override-colors:0 red}

```


# Formatted

```scss
$name: brand;
@font-palette-values --palette-#{$name}2 {
	font-family: "Bixa";
}
@font-palette-values --palette-#{$name} {
	font-family: "Bixa";
	override-colors: 0 red;
}
@font-palette-values --#{$name}-dark {
	font-family: "Bixa";
	base-palette: 1;
}
@font-palette-values /* before */ --palette-#{$name} /* after */ {
	font-family: "Bixa";
}
@font-palette-values --palette-#{/* expression */ $name} {
	font-family: "Bixa";
}
@font-palette-values --Palette {
	font-family: "Bixa";
	override-colors: 1 blue;
}

// biome-ignore format: preserve the source layout
@font-palette-values   --palette-#{ $name } {font-family:"Bixa";override-colors:0 red}

```

# Lines exceeding max width of 80 characters
```
   25: @font-palette-values   --palette-#{ $name } {font-family:"Bixa";override-colors:0 red}
```
